The DirectX 11 renderer draws the OwnedSurfaceFrame of 0001: per-stream R8 luma and R8G8 chroma textures,
uploaded with UpdateSubresource when the generation changes, and a new surface shader in shaders.hlsl
(P42, P27 win).

